{"_kind": "doc", "slug": "nt7kqggycqkm01z4", "title": "79.Coze工作流编写代码执行特定任务", "content": "<!doctype lake><meta name=\"doc-version\" content=\"1\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"fixed\" /><meta name=\"typography\" content=\"classic\" /><meta name=\"paragraphSpacing\" content=\"relax\" /><p data-lake-id=\"uba6c1db1\" id=\"uba6c1db1\"><span data-lake-id=\"u7313b6c9\" id=\"u7313b6c9\">你可以在工作流内添加 Code 节点编写代码处理任务。例如，本教程中将使用 Code 节点生成随机数。 </span></p><h2 data-lake-id=\"8d598cba\" id=\"8d598cba\"><span data-lake-id=\"u152e0b3d\" id=\"u152e0b3d\">效果示例 </span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"uc6792878\" id=\"uc6792878\"><span data-lake-id=\"u365a86fc\" id=\"u365a86fc\">本文构建的示例工作流节点概览如下图所示，该工作流中添加  Code 节点用于生成电子卡密 </span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u6defd998\" id=\"u6defd998\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2025%2Fpng%2F2424104%2F1744191734504-0a8c8e2a-7326-4f1f-9d1c-0e7d7fc489f5.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22ud3f04040-6bab-4ef5-9b2f-b302b6419b4%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22ufa832df3-9b9e-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22url%22%2C%22width%22%3A1930%2C%22height%22%3A231%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1930%2C%22originHeight%22%3A231%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.6500000953674316%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22LBOT_USER_INPUT%22%2C%22x%22%3A154%2C%22y%22%3A113%2C%22width%22%3A187%2C%22height%22%3A28%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E8%BE%93%E5%87%BASTROUTPUT%22%2C%22x%22%3A1345%2C%22y%22%3A115%2C%22width%22%3A174%2C%22height%22%3A29%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22STRRANDOM%22%2C%22x%22%3A776%2C%22y%22%3A137%2C%22width%22%3A104%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22G%E5%BC%80%E5%A7%8B%22%2C%22x%22%3A61%2C%22y%22%3A68%2C%22width%22%3A102%2C%22height%22%3A32%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22STRLENGTH%22%2C%22x%22%3A766%2C%22y%22%3A98%2C%22width%22%3A106%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22O%22%2C%22x%22%3A1116%2C%22y%22%3A51%2C%