data-lake-id=\"u56a96a6a\" id=\"u56a96a6a\">扣子</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"u522a6174\" id=\"u522a6174\">平台。 </span></li><li fid=\"u9ddd1846\" data-lake-id=\"ua432ba71\" id=\"ua432ba71\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue42c65ef\" id=\"ue42c65ef\">在左侧导航栏中选择</span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u2d27cf20\" id=\"u2d27cf20\">工作空间</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"udeb91f99\" id=\"udeb91f99\">，并在页面顶部空间列表中选择目标工作空间。 </span></li><li fid=\"u9ddd1846\" data-lake-id=\"u79943d83\" id=\"u79943d83\"><span data-lake-id=\"u62c47be1\" id=\"u62c47be1\">从左侧导航栏进入</span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u01b9eaa3\" id=\"u01b9eaa3\">资源库</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u68da4db4\" id=\"u68da4db4\">页面。</span></li><li fid=\"u9ddd1846\" data-lake-id=\"ud80306d4\" id=\"ud80306d4\"><span data-lake-id=\"uacbd7a6c\" id=\"uacbd7a6c\">在页面右上角，单击 </span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u0621b1c5\" id=\"u0621b1c5\">+资源</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"uf3fe704b\" id=\"uf3fe704b\"> &gt; </span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ua48b5ea6\" id=\"ua48b5ea6\">工作流</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u2815849d\" id=\"u2815849d\">。 </span></li></ol><p data-lake-id=\"u2bed1394\" id=\"u2bed1394\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua798bb9a\" id=\"ua798bb9a\">本文示例配置如下： </span></p><ul list=\"u3841b612\" data-lake-indent=\"1\"><li fid=\"ub4bb347b\" data-lake-id=\"ua9591da2\" id=\"ua9591da2\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"uc7be78e4\" id=\"uc7be78e4\">工作流名称</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u6467f9c9\" id=\"u6467f9c9\">：输入 </span><span data-lake-id=\"ud6e31f72\" id=\"ud6e31f72\">random_number</span></li><li fid=\"ub4bb347b\" data-lake-id=\"u120d0043\" id=\"u120d0043\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u95da1b96\" id=\"u95da1b96\">工作流描述</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u645b6662\" id=\"u645b6662\">：输入 </span><span data-lake-id=\"u929aa7fa\" id=\"u929aa7fa\">生成随机数</span></li></ul><ol list=\"u8cf2bc89\" start=\"5\"><li fid=\"u9ddd1846\" data-lake-id=\"ua2968bec\" id=\"ua2968bec\"><span data-lake-id=\"u62dcbfd1\" id=\"u62dcbfd1\">在工作流的编辑页面，从左侧</span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u3fbf3c19\" id=\"u3fbf3c19\">选择节点</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u2bdd1316\" id=\"u2bdd1316\">列表，选用</span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u841cb541\" id=\"u841cb541\">代码</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u393c877c\" id=\"u393c877c\">节点。 </span></li><li fid=\"u9ddd1846\" data-lake-id=\"ud91a3fec\" id=\"ud91a3fec\"><span data-lake-id=\"u04cc55fd\" id=\"u04cc55fd\">连接各节点，并依次配置输入输出参数。 </span></li></ol><p data-lake-id=\"u40e7ff83\" id=\"u40e7ff83\"><span data-lake-id=\"u2de66a96\" id=\"u2de66a96\">节点连接顺序：</span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u30b459cc\" id=\"u30b459cc\">开始 → 代码 → 结束</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"uf3acacb7\" id=\"uf3acacb7\">，各节点参数配置说明如下表。 </span></p><table data-lake-id=\"jbLC2\" id=\"jbLC2\" margin=\"true\" class=\"lake-table\" style=\"width: 822px\"><colgroup><col width=\"127\"><col width=\"695\"></colgroup><tbody><tr data-lake-id=\"uef74c9fe\" id=\"uef74c9fe\"><td data-lake-id=\"ubc4b3f75\" id=\"ubc4b3f75\"><p data-lake-id=\"u2b950528\" id=\"u2b950528\" style=\"text-indent: 2em\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u05d9e9bb\" id=\"u05d9e9bb\">节点</span></strong></p></td><td data-lake-id=\"u9bcfc106\" id=\"u9bcfc106\"><p data-lake-id=\"ub16ce7d7\" id=\"ub16ce7d7\" style=\"text-indent: 2em\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u7ac6aab6\" id=\"u7ac6aab6\">参数配置</span></strong></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id=\"u80d7a90a\" id=\"u80d7a90a\"><td data-lake-id=\"u8884e80d\" id=\"u8884e80d\"><p data-lake-id=\"u4a89c2a2\" id=\"u4a89c2a2\" style=\"text-indent: 2em\"><span data-lake-id=\"u637b7779\" id=\"u637b7779\">开始 </span></p></td><td data-lake-id=\"u0d148dd6\" id=\"u0d148dd6\"><p data-lake-id=\"u420b96e4\" id=\"u420b96e4\" style=\"text-indent: 2em\"><span data-lake-id=\"ubc2bef5b\" id=\"ubc2bef5b\">新增 </span><span data-lake-id=\"uc9b5d567\" id=\"uc9b5d567\">input_length</span><span data-lake-id=\"u9c5968bf\" id=\"u9c5968bf\"> 输入参数，并选择 </span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u43aaff1f\" id=\"u43aaff1f\">String</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u95567a98\" id=\"u95567a98\"> 数据类型。 </span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id=\"ucded56e2\" id=\"ucded56e2\"><td data-lake-id=\"u5caccc56\" id=\"u5caccc56\"><p data-lake-id=\"u27ae94d4\" id=\"u27ae94d4\" style=\"text-indent: 2em\"><span data-lake-id=\"u6d828e5e\" id=\"u6d828e5e\">代码 </span></p></td><td data-lake-id=\"u9c01d18e\" id=\"u9c01d18e\"><ul list=\"u1c65f07a\"><li fid=\"u6b4739a6\" data-lake-id=\"u4848d7d8\" id=\"u4848d7d8\"><span data-lake-id=\"u597af33d\" id=\"u597af33d\">新增 </span><span data-lake-id=\"u30748c97\" id=\"u30748c97\">length</span><span data-lake-id=\"u05b3cb16\" id=\"u05b3cb16\"> 输入参数，并在</span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u06ce9973\" id=\"u06ce9973\">参数值</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u9946de50\" id=\"u9946de50\">区域选择</span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u62f8c97d\" id=\"u62f8c97d\">引用 Start &gt; input_length</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u5d8b55f2\" id=\"u5d8b55f2\">。 </span></li><li fid=\"u6b4739a6\" data-lake-id=\"uacc230b1\" id=\"uacc230b1\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub8f407b3\" id=\"ub8f407b3\">在 Code 节点打开 IDE，清空默认内容并添加以下代码，该代码用于生成随机数。 </span></li></ul><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22java%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22async%20function%20main(%7B%20params%20%7D%3A%20Args)%3A%20Promise%3COutput%3E%20%7B%5Cn%5Cnvar%20IDX%20%3D%2036%2C%20HEX%20%3D%20''%3B%20%5Cn%5Cnwhile%20(IDX--)%20HEX%20%2B%3D%20IDX.toString(36)%3B%20%5Cn%5Cn%5Cn%5Cn%2F%2F%20%40see%20https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Flukeed%2Fuid%2Fblob%2Fmaster%2Fsrc%2Fsingle.js%20%5Cn%5Cnfunction%20uid(len)%20%7B%20%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20var%20str%20%3D%20''%2C%20num%20%3D%20len%20%7C%7C%2011%3B%20%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20while%20(num--)%20str%20%2B%3D%20HEX%5BMath.random()%20*%2036%20%7C%200%5D%3B%20%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20return%20str%3B%20%5Cn%5Cn%7D%20%5Cn%5Cn%5Cn%5Cnconst%20ret%20%3D%20%7B%20%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22random%5C%22%3A%20uid(params.length)%2C%20%5Cn%5Cn%7D%20%5Cn%5Cnreturn%20ret%20%5Cn%5Cn%7D%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22i0beG%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><ul list=\"ucccd65e8\"><li fid=\"uc89de061\" data-lake-id=\"uc3aa5607\" id=\"uc3aa5607\"><span data-lake-id=\"u94c4e17c\" id=\"u94c4e17c\">新增 </span><span data-lake-id=\"ua210d1fd\" id=\"ua210d1fd\">random</span><span data-lake-id=\"ue0f4d7ba\" id=\"ue0f4d7ba\"> 输出值，数据类型选择 </span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u56fb10d1\" id=\"u56fb10d1\">String</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u4cfd0656\" id=\"u4cfd0656\">。 </span></li></ul></td></tr><tr data-lake-id=\"ud669fa36\" id=\"ud669fa36\"><td data-lake-id=\"uf49f2d88\" id=\"uf49f2d88\"><p data-lake-id=\"u1f8e0a61\" id=\"u1f8e0a61\" style=\"text-indent: 2em\"><span data-lake-id=\"u7dd9ac3a\" id=\"u7dd9ac3a\">结束 </span></p></td><td data-lake-id=\"u55631bce\" id=\"u55631bce\"><p data-lake-id=\"u18cc4b73\" id=\"u18cc4b73\" style=\"text-indent: 2em\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc0f16756\" id=\"uc0f16756\">新增 </span><span data-lake-id=\"uff6d8e6f\" id=\"uff6d8e6f\">output</span><span data-lake-id=\"uc7b63f3f\" id=\"uc7b63f3f\"> 输入参数，并在</span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u3d306940\" id=\"u3d306940\">参数值</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u498ca0b6\" id=\"u498ca0b6\">区域选择</span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u661c9bb5\" id=\"u661c9bb5\">引用 Code &gt; random</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"uff1bf69d\" id=\"uff1bf69d\">。 </span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><ol list=\"u8cf2bc89\" start=\"7\"><li fid=\"u9ddd1846\" data-lake-id=\"u73392261\" id=\"u73392261\"><span data-lake-id=\"u31b90667\" id=\"u31b90667\">配置完成后，单击页面右上角的试运行，测试工作流。 </span></li></ol><p data-lake-id=\"u3746d2f9\" id=\"u3746d2f9\"><span data-lake-id=\"u0